<title>USA: Fort Howard sets merger meeting date.</title>
<headline>Fort Howard sets merger meeting date.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fort Howard Corp said Monday it has set August 12 as the date for the special stockholder meeting to vote on the merger agreement with James River Corp.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record at the close of business on June 30 will be entitled to vote. Fort Howard said it intends to distribute proxy statements no later than July 15.</p>
<p>The proposed merger requires U.S. regulatory consent in addition to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
